    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can spend one use of Devotion to target a creature you can see within 60 feet. The creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by you for 1 minute. If you or your companions do anything harmful to it, the effect ends. Once the effect ends, the creature doesn't knows it was charmed by you.</p>",
